12:["$","article",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-12 sm:px-8","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-500","children":[["$","$L14",null,{"className":"transition hover:text-cyan-200","href":"/","children":"Home"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"/"}],["$","$L14",null,{"className":"transition hover:text-cyan-200","href":"/blog","children":"Blog"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"/"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-slate-300","children":"How to Handle Late Invoice Payments Professionally"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap gap-2","children":[["$","span","Late Payment",{"className":"rounded-full bg-white/8 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-cyan-200","children":"Late Payment"}],["$","span","Reminders",{"className":"rounded-full bg-white/8 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-cyan-200","children":"Reminders"}],["$","span","Cash Flow",{"className":"rounded-full bg-white/8 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-cyan-200","children":"Cash Flow"}]]}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"mt-5 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl","children":"How to Handle Late Invoice Payments Professionally"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300","children":"Learn how to handle late invoice payments with reminder timelines, WhatsApp messages, email templates, payment terms and overdue invoice tips."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-sm text-slate-500","children":["26 May 2026"," · ",13," min read · ","InvoiceWala Team"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-10","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose prose-invert max-w-none prose-headings:tracking-tight prose-a:text-cyan-300","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"# How to Handle Late Invoice Payments Professionally"}]]}],["$","p","1",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Late invoice payments are one of the most common cash flow problems for freelancers, contractors, agencies, consultants and small businesses. You finish the work, send the invoice, wait for payment, and then the due date passes quietly. The awkward part begins after that: how do you remind the client without sounding rude?"}]]}],["$","p","2",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The answer is to build a clear late payment process. A professional follow-up does not need to feel aggressive. It should be specific, polite and consistent. Mention the invoice number, amount, original due date and payment method. Keep the first reminder friendly. If the payment remains overdue, increase the firmness while staying professional."}]]}],["$","p","3",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"This guide explains how to handle late invoice payments in India with reminder timelines, WhatsApp messages, email templates, payment terms, prevention tips and practical examples. You can also use InvoiceWala's "}],["$","$L14","1",{"className":"font-semibold text-cyan-300 underline-offset-2 hover:underline","href":"/tools/payment-reminder-generator","children":"payment reminder generator"}],["$","span","2",{"children":" to write polite reminders faster."}]]}],["$","h2","4",{"className":"mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-white","children":"Quick Answer"}],["$","p","5",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"If an invoice is late, send a polite reminder on the due date or one day after. Follow up again after 3 days, then send a firmer reminder after 7 days. If the invoice is still unpaid after 14 days, request a clear payment date and pause new work if needed."}]]}],"$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a","$L2b","$L